{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_005_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f317a4313c8391be3ec272b19453fb539e31117b2ebbfd6b86b02c7ab13dfd03",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48773afb2d65a1cfbcdbbbe98e31eedb3c52dc1314764be73a2cd7a2ffe7ef01",
      "text": "你之后还要继续工作吧。\n为了防止你再次倒下，我就在这里盯着你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f27c53a0c924d790d58409fae79246c9662d8f88c1c3fc4da8969a844c167c54",
      "text": "不，太不好意思了。\n没必要为了我做到这种地步……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d606c1199fc1460c218239e82909dd4f6643630995db81246930fd0dd39930ad",
      "text": "我可不是为了你。\n是为了让我们的工作能够顺利进行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1384621fe9ad48e03b08d73d03f03c166ad621ea90b557822c789608747f7fb9",
      "text": "而且今天的事务所很安静。\n适合读剧本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c916b0a0b3b84d9dc52574f6e08436d7232d067af2e9da7f7d11ba8c20df899f",
      "text": "（是在顾虑我啊……真感激）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aad51f35f16399207a90c7bc460d83f0ab92323d5a1dbf05331f55e9dd5c5d2",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n那我去把剩下的工作做完。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e31acec8345f914206e4a21331c799fdfe322e8d4f7c925975641a4bc218ea0f",
      "text": "嗯。\n要是觉得不舒服，立刻告诉我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12020c3f6eff87ecd3918b1827c40ae40a96bef52d24762b680e55afa37b4314",
      "text": "好的，我知道了。\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d326948077012345b3c74330f14ff1cca4b5c71649700637116d22bd596fea97",
      "text": "（耳边传来了薰先生翻阅剧本的声音。\n为了让那份工作顺利成功，我也要加油！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f85e8f5affa8de7233bebf1406ede81cbed01c9bd101d4b3a383918c9822063e",
      "text": "……哼。这份宁静，倒也不坏。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
